  m_Name: Kal 1 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: I had a lot of friends in Damton. They were good people. It was a town of
    farmers. Massive crop fields surrounded the town, they kept all of us fed. I
    don't know what we're going to do. Johnny is still down there, looking for any
    more survivors.
  option1:
    text: 'What a terrible day. '
